<title>INDIA: Port conditions update - India -  Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - India -  Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>TUTICORIN, July 14 - Stevedore labour strike called off and work resumed with first shift of July 13.</p>
<p>JAWAHARLAL NEHRU, July 14 - The introduction of the congestion surcharge is to be suspended.</p>
</text>
